OL,3,GNEWSAMotorist dies as car ends up in
OL,4,Awater
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after his car left a
OL,7,Froad and ended up in water.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to
OL,10,FWestville Road, Frithville, north of
OL,11,FBoston, just after 09:45 BST on
OL,12,FThursday after a red Volkswagen ID4
OL,13,Fcrashed into West Fen Drain.
OL,15,FThe car, which was heading towards
OL,16,FConingsby, was pulled out of the water
OL,17,Fbut the 41-year-old driver was declared
OL,18,Fdead at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
